[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "あの、私に、考えがあるのですが……！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 7061794453237574237,
    "text": "赤のほうき星のこと？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "そもそも、白きほうき星は\nどうして赤のほうき星になったんだろう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "赤く変心した……って話だったよね。\nそれも突然",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "もし、もしもだよ。赤くなったことには原因があって、\nその原因を取り除くことができれば――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "赤のほうき星を、白きほうき星に戻せるかもしれない\nってことね！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "赤のほうき星を倒すんじゃなく、「治す」ってこと？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "うん。錬金術の力があれば、もしかしたらって",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "ロマン",
    "romanized_name": "Roman",
    "model_path_hash": 2044084852602675005,
    "text": "もし「治す」ことができれば、白きほうき星による\nマナの恵みも戻ってくるかもしれない！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2419706081160656678,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 7061794453237574237,
    "text": "すごいやレスナちゃん！\nそれができれば、全部上手くいくかも！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "赤のほうき星を、「治す」か……\n私たちは考えてすらいなかったな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "自分たちを守るために必死だった……\nなんて、言い訳にもならないかしら",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "私たちは恐怖や憎しみで、目が曇っていたのかもね。\n……ただ、それでも……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "今を生きるレスナだからこその思考。\nレスナらしい他を尊ぶ心、か",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "今はまだ、なんの根拠もない話ではあるけれど――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "赤のほうき星となって災厄をもたらすようになったのは\n白きほうき星が望んでいたことじゃないと思うんだ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "だから、赤のほうき星――白きほうき星を、\n助けてあげたい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "皆さん、まずは調査から始めてみませんか。\n黄金星でなら、新しい痕跡が見つけられるかも……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "錬金術はみんなを幸せにするもの。\nそうですよね、師匠",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "ええ、その通りね。だけど赤のほうき星は、それこそ\n対話ができずに駆除するしかない魔物と同じだと思うわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "お前の話は、いずれも希望的観測に過ぎない。\n我々の文明を滅亡させたほどの脅威なのだぞ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "……だが、赤のほうき星の群れが\n今すぐやって来るわけでもない。試す時間はある",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "あなたは私に勝ったのだし、\nレスナが思うように、やれるだけやってみなさい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "負けたのに、なんか上からっすね……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "やったわね、レスナ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "うん！　みんなも、ありがとう！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "……ベップ、仇のことだけど",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "……正直、まだ思うところはある。\nでもね、姉様――私も、レスナの調査に協力したい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "二度と赤のほうき星による被害が起きないようにする。\nそれだって、きっと仇討ちになると思うから",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "うん……そうだね！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "成長したわね、レスナ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "localized_name": "アウグスト",
    "romanized_name": "August",
    "model_path_hash": 4783526781539751219,
    "text": "……ああ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4550481465929894494,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]